// The plan beside this file tells "the graph was printed and nothing ran" from "the graph was
// printed and the program ran" by the exit code: this program returns 7, so 0 means the run never
// happened and 7 means it did. The exit code is not part of any graph, so a dump cannot fake it.
func main() => int sync {
    println("ran")
    return 7
}